# Watchman probe files. Watchman drops these into any directory it watches to
# verify the watch is live, then deletes them; one got committed because it
# happened to exist when something ran `git add`. They are never ours to keep.
.watchman-cookie-*

# This project uses yarn. An npm lockfile here means someone ran `npm install`,
# which resolves independently of yarn.lock and silently drifts the two apart —
# apps/mobile carried both for a while and they disagreed.
package-lock.json
